      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:4:1:7:5",
      "text": [
        " قَالَ صَاحِبُ النِّعْمَةِ يَجِبُ عَلَيْهِ التَّوْسِعَةُ عَنْ عِيَالِهِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "A number of our companions, from Sahl Bin Ziyad, from Ibn Abu Nasr, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Al-Reza<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘The owner of the bounties, it is Obligated upon him that he extends upon his dependants’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "5. A number of our people have narrated from Sahl ibn Ziyad from ibn abu Nasr who has said the following: “Al-Rida, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘A wealthy person should improve the quality of life of his family.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
